{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "sedimentation_jh2010_face_value",
    "description": "DONOR FACE VALUE of the Juang & Hong (2010) forward semi-Lagrangian fallout (WRF WSM6 nislfv_rain_plm / nislfv_rain_plm6) on column_nonuniform_1d, in its dt -> 0 limit: the value at the LOWER face of a layer of falling density q0, reconstructed from the layer and its two neighbours (qm1 below, qp1 above) on a non-uniform column (thicknesses dzm1, dz0, dzp1). For downward flow the lower face of a layer is fed by that layer, so this is the upwind value of the face below it. WRF forms the two one-sided differences over SUMS of adjacent thicknesses, dip = (qp1 - q0)/(dzp1 + dz0) and dim = (q0 - qm1)/(dzm1 + dz0), and sets the face value to q0 - h with h = (dip + dim) dz0 / 2 -- the AVERAGE of the two one-sided slopes, carried half a layer down. Two branches, both kept as branches because they ARE the scheme: (1) at an extremum of q, dip dim <= 0, the slope is zeroed and the face value is q0; (2) if either face value q0 - h or q0 + h would be negative the slope is also dropped. Branch (2) is written as |h| <= q0, which is the same test exactly (q0 + h and q0 - h are both >= 0 iff |h| <= q0, and the subtraction is exact near the boundary by Sterbenz's lemma). THIS IS NOT A TEXTBOOK LIMITER: the slope is the average of the one-sided differences, not their minmod and not the monotonized-central limit, and on a measured WRF column a minmod reconstruction in its place leaves 31.6 % of the difference to WRF that this closes. Do not 'simplify' it to a library limiter. WRF's finite-dt arrival cells dza reduce to the layer thicknesses as dt -> 0, which is the form here; at the MODEL TOP the rule binds qp1 = 0 and dzp1 = 0, because WRF's qa(km+1) = 0 and dza(km+1) = wi(km+1) dt -> 0. The bottom layer (face 1) takes no reconstruction in WRF (qmi(1) = qa(1)) and is written in the rule's boundary region. THREE TEMPLATES, ONE RECONSTRUCTION: sedimentation_jh2010_half_jump is the limited h itself (h, or 0 where either branch drops the slope); sedimentation_jh2010_face_value = q0 - h is the value at the layer's LOWER face (WRF's qmi) and sedimentation_jh2010_top_face_value = q0 + h the value at its UPPER face (WRF's qpi). The upper-face value is needed because the donor of a face is its UPWIND side: where WRF's third-order interface speed overshoots below zero, the mass crossing the face comes up from the top of the layer below (sedimentation_jh2010_face_flux).",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:stencil",
      "family:finite_volume",
      "grid:column_nonuniform_1d",
      "op:reconstruct",
      "axes:lev",
      "order:2",
      "stencil_width:3"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Juang, H.-M. H., & Hong, S.-Y. (2010). Forward semi-Lagrangian advection with mass conservation and positive definiteness for falling hydrometeors. Monthly Weather Review, 138(5), 1778-1791.",
        "doi": "10.1175/2009MWR3109.1"
      },
      {
        "citation": "WRF v4.8.0 / NCAR MMM-physics 550b5b4, phys/physics_mmm/mp_wsm6.F90, subroutine nislfv_rain_plm: 'estimate values at arrival cell interface with monotone' (dip, dim, qpi, qmi)."
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [
    {"ref": "../grid.esm"}
  ],
  "expression_templates": {
    "sedimentation_jh2010_half_jump": {
      "params": ["qm1", "q0", "qp1", "dzm1", "dz0", "dzp1"],
      "body": {
        "op": "ifelse",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "and",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": ">",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["qp1", "q0"]}, {"op": "+", "args": ["dzp1", "dz0"]}]},
                      {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["q0", "qm1"]}, {"op": "+", "args": ["dzm1", "dz0"]}]}
                    ]
                  },
                  0
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "<=",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "abs",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "*",
                        "args": [
                          0.5,
                          "dz0",
                          {
                            "op": "+",
                            "args": [
                              {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["qp1", "q0"]}, {"op": "+", "args": ["dzp1", "dz0"]}]},
                              {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["q0", "qm1"]}, {"op": "+", "args": ["dzm1", "dz0"]}]}
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "q0"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              0.5,
              "dz0",
              {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                  {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["qp1", "q0"]}, {"op": "+", "args": ["dzp1", "dz0"]}]},
                  {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["q0", "qm1"]}, {"op": "+", "args": ["dzm1", "dz0"]}]}
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          0
        ]
      }
    },
    "sedimentation_jh2010_face_value": {
      "params": ["qm1", "q0", "qp1", "dzm1", "dz0", "dzp1"],
      "body": {
        "op": "-",
        "args": [
          "q0",
          {
            "op": "apply_expression_template",
            "args": [],
            "name": "sedimentation_jh2010_half_jump",
            "bindings": {"qm1": "qm1", "q0": "q0", "qp1": "qp1", "dzm1": "dzm1", "dz0": "dz0", "dzp1": "dzp1"}
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "sedimentation_jh2010_top_face_value": {
      "params": ["qm1", "q0", "qp1", "dzm1", "dz0", "dzp1"],
      "body": {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
          "q0",
          {
            "op": "apply_expression_template",
            "args": [],
            "name": "sedimentation_jh2010_half_jump",
            "bindings": {"qm1": "qm1", "q0": "q0", "qp1": "qp1", "dzm1": "dzm1", "dz0": "dz0", "dzp1": "dzp1"}
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
